"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4024170","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1845383656397287","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo Available!","summary":"The Demo has been updated to ver 0.54.3, which includes more to play! Are you ready for First-Person Struggling, or are you more the type to rack up those Good Boy Points?Development on the full game has been coming along really well, especially regarding visual assets. I've added dozens of new CGs, BGs and cutins.You can see more of these shots in the new trailer, linked at the top of this post and now on the main game page. It's really a delight to see how they're transforming scenes. I can ba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:14:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397287","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1842212951314275","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"announcement","title":"Fall in Love Festival and NPF Streams All Week!","summary":"The Fall in Love Visual Novel Festival has begun, and NPF is participating! This is one of the best times of year to go find solid recommendations for Indie VNs. The festival's being run by our pals over at Studio Elan, and they've curated some of the good stuff.Five streamers have scheduled to stream the demo (times in EST):Sept 1st 9:00 PM - MisamouserSept 2nd 6:30 PM - Stella De (She'll be interviewing me before we start, wish me luck!)Sept 3rd 12:30 AM - JMckennaStoriesSept 4th 5:00 PM - Emp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T17:29:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1842212951301580","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"update","title":"August Production Update - All Sprites Complete!","summary":"Hey all! I just sent ver 0.53 to Patrons, which included the final character sprites, and over a dozen more CGs and art assets. Let's take a quick look at what's new:Thank you so much to everyone who's wishlisted the game so far! We've passed 1,500 wishlists, just in time for the Fall in Love festival next week. Keep an eyes out for folks who'll be streaming the game, and maybe you'll even be hearing from me too!-Royce","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T23:45:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1836506165555013","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"update","title":"June 2026 Production Update","summary":"Hello all! Production is rolling right along, and testers who get monthly builds now have ver 0.52.It includes:Heavy work on text edits and new sprites, including finishing the introductory scene for these folks:More art, both digitally drawn or hand-painted in watercolor. And a lot more photobashed backgrounds. Most of them are my photos, but Tsush has helped me out when I'm too much of a coward to really get in and get the shot I need.Overhauls to the CG, BG and Comic Galleries,A new Music Roo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T19:17:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165555013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1832065502822078","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"announcement","title":"Storyteller's Festival 2026 and Other Updates","summary":"NonPlatonic Forms is joining the 2026 Storyteller's Festival! You can check it out on the event page here. The turnout for this one was great last year, so get ready to find a lot of undiscovered gems for your wishlist. And if you're here from the festival, then heya! Enjoy dark stories with darker romances? Check out our demo and wishlist NPF today!And speaking of NPF, I just updated the demo to ver 0.48.3, which adds a wishlist button to the title screen. But behind the scenes, a lot more has ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T17:50:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502822078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1830163047267118","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"announcement","title":"April 2026 - Production Coming Along Well!","summary":"Hey all, Royce here! I've been hard at work on the rest of the game!The first full playable draft of the game was done and coded in January. I've finished the first structure edit, and I've added almost all of the final sprites. The game's gone from what was once a tiny, one-shot game for my Patreon backers in 2022:To a deeply branching, 250,000 word game, with limited animation and cinematography:I've finished most of the sprites so far, also! I had placeholders while writing the first draft:Bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T20:33:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047267118","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1825727806711941","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated to ver 0.48.2","summary":"Just one more quick update to the demo and the patreon build. This adds:Diegesis' animated sprite! This isn't the most important thing, but it would have to get in there sometime anyway,Minor expression tweaks,A menuing bugfix,Some updates to how Streaming Mode censors the Stagehands scene. Big shoutout to Dusty Manson Otome for giving me some solid advice on what specific content could get Youtubers in trouble. I'll be better able to edit going forward. Click that link for Dusty's LP of the 0.4","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-27T20:29:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806711941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3035800-1825093633186337","game_id":"steam-3035800","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated!","summary":"Hey all! The Demo has been updated to ver 0.48.1, which adds two new CGs and one new sprite. The CGs are viewable in the extras gallery once unlocked.I don't plan on doing frequent updates to the demo; I'm hard at work on the structure edit for NPF and painting final art. But since the demo is the beginning of the game, it seemed silly not to share these with you all.Anyway, hang in there, folks. We're nearly through February. You got this, and I'll see you all later.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-19T21:12:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633186337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3035800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:23Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3035800":"2026-10-26T10:15:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3035800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-2